g_string ffprobe-style, primary_audio_duration_seconds (string with 6 decimals like ffprobe '1.250000'), primary_audio_nb_samples / duration_ts, format_name (ffprobe demuxer: wav, mp3, ogg, flac, aiff, amr, au, 'mov,mp4,m4a,3gp,3g2,mj2', 'matroska,webm'), format_long_name, nb_streams, audio_stream_count, format_duration_seconds, format_size_bytes, format_bit_rate. WAV: data chunk size / byte rate; MP3: Xing/Info/VBRI frames or frame walk; Ogg: last page granule / rate (Opus 48 kHz minus pre_skip); FLAC: STREAMINFO total samples; MP4: mdhd timescale/duration.\"},\n {\"id\":\"media-wav-deep\",\"concept\":\"WAV chunk-level metadata (BWF bext, fact, LIST/INFO, cue, iXML, data-vs-RIFF size, trailing bytes)\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"fmt media + wav alias, fields riff_chunk_ids (file order JSON), info_title (INAM; D17 carried 'Huntress audio evidence <12 hex>'), info_software (ISFT), info_creation_date (ICRD), info_comment (ICMT), info_artist (IART), bext_description, bext_originator, bext_originator_reference, bext_origination_date, bext_origination_time, bext_time_reference, bext_umid_hex, fact_sample_count, data_chunk_size_bytes, riff_size_declared, riff_size_mismatch (declared+8 != len), trailing_bytes_after_data (count + magic_prefix_hex_16 of the trailer -> hidden payload), cue_point_count, ixml_present. Pure struct; values verbatim (strip trailing NULs).\"},\n {\"id\":\"media-renamed-containers\",\"concept\":\"Renamed/transcoded audio: actual container + codec vs the extension\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"fmt media, fields container_format (by magic: wav/rf64/aiff/mp3/ogg/flac/mp4/matroska/amr/au/adts/caf/wma-asf), declared_extension, extension_matches_content (true/false), mime_type_by_magic (audio/wav, audio/mpeg, audio/ogg, audio/flac, audio/mp4, audio/amr), plus primary_audio_codec_name for: ASF/WMA (GUID 3026b275 + stream props -> wmav2), CAF ('caff' desc fourcc), MP4 esds objectTypeIndication (0x40 aac, 0x6b mp3), Ogg multiple codecs. Flavor D17: 'Voice notes have been transcoded, renamed'.\"},\n {\"id\":\"media-multistream\",\"concept\":\"Per-stream fields in multi-stream containers; the odd stream\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"fmt media, fields stream_codec_names (JSON, container stream index order like ffprobe), audio_stream_codec_names, stream_languages (MP4 mdhd packed ISO-639-2 / MKV Language default 'eng' / 'und'), stream_titles (MKV Name, MP4 udta name/handler_name), stream_creation_times_utc (mdhd 1904 epoch), stream_durations_seconds, stream_sample_rates, primary_video_codec_name, odd_stream_index (the one whose codec/language/rate/creation_time differs from the majority -- emit index and a JSON diagnostic). MP4 box walk moov/trak/mdia/{mdhd,hdlr,minf/stbl/stsd}; Matroska EBML walk Segment/Tracks/TrackEntry (TrackType 2=audio, CodecID map A_OPUS opus, A_VORBIS vorbis, A_AAC aac, A_FLAC flac, A_MPEG/L3 mp3, A_PCM/INT/LIT pcm_s16le by BitDepth, A_AC3 ac3, V_MPEG4/ISO/AVC h264, V_MPEGH/ISO/HEVC hevc, V_VP9 vp9, V_AV1 av1); Ogg: group pages by serial, BOS packet per stream. Flavor D17: 'find the stream that breaks the sender's story'.\"},\n {\"id\":\"media-format-tags\",\"concept\":\"Container/stream tags: title, artist, comment, encoder, creation_time, language\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"fmt media, fields tag_title, tag_artist, tag_album, tag_comment, tag_encoder, tag_date, tag_creation_time_utc, tag_<key> generic (lowercase ffprobe key), encoder (ffprobe format tag 'encoder': ID3 TSSE, Vorbis/Opus ENCODER + vendor string, MP4 \\\\xa9too, MKV MuxingApp/WritingApp, WAV ISFT), opus_vendor / vorbis_vendor, id3_version. Sources: WAV LIST/INFO, ID3v2.2-2.4 (+v1), Vorbis comment (Ogg/FLAC/Opus OpusTags), MP4 moov/udta/meta/ilst, MKV Tags. Reuse prebuilt mp3/wav parsers where possible; stdlib only (mutagen is not allowlisted).\"},\n {\"id\":\"email-media-attachments\",\"concept\":\"Audio embedded in mail: MIME audio attachments + member resolution through .eml\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"fmt email (+eml/mime aliases), fields attachment_audio_codec_names (MIME order, via the media codec extractor on decoded payloads), attachment_media_container_formats, attachment_declared_content_types, attachment_audio_mismatch_names (declared Content-Type/extension vs actual codec), attachment_audio_durations_seconds, audio_attachment_count. Also expose lib.meta.prebuilt helper attachment_bytes(eml_bytes, filename) (RFC 2231/2047 filename decode, get_payload(decode=True)) so artifact refs like `message-001.eml -> voice-001.ogg` and `zip -> eml -> wav` resolve. Flavor D17: 'embedded in mail'.\"},\n {\"id\":\"media-equivalence-synthesis\",\"concept\":\"Cross-recording equivalence / odd-one-out synthesis\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"Add to lib.meta.synthesis: equivalence_groups(question, get_bytes) over the `Files: [...]` audio members -> group by (1) shared title/correlation tag (WAV INAM, ID3 TIT2, Vorbis TITLE, MP4 \\\\xa9nam; D17 INAM 'Huntress audio evidence <12 hex>'), (2) equal decoded duration rounded to 10 ms / equal sample count, (3) equal PCM data-chunk sha256 or FLAC STREAMINFO MD5; outputs compact JSON array of arrays of filenames (each group sorted, groups by first name), the odd_one_out filename, duplicate_count. Also md5/sha1/size-order variants of digest_order (synthesis-siblings). Spelling unverified -> keep alternates.\"},\n {\"id\":\"flac-opus-headers\",\"concept\":\"FLAC STREAMINFO / OpusHead / Vorbis identification header fields\",\"priority\":2,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"fmt media (+flac/ogg/opus aliases), fields flac_min_block_size, flac_max_block_size, flac_sample_rate, flac_channels, flac_bits_per_sample, flac_total_samples, flac_md5_signature (32 hex, 'none' when all zero), flac_metadata_block_types, opus_version, opus_channel_count, opus_pre_skip, opus_input_sample_rate, opus_output_gain, opus_channel_mapping_